<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:s="https://wvusports.com/services/xml_schema/story" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title /><link>https://wvusports.com/rss/</link><description /><atom:link href="https://wvusports.com/rss" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><language>en-us</language><ttl>60</ttl><item><title>Mountaineers to Face Maryland Sunday in First Preseason Tuneup</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/16/mens-basketball-mountaineers-to-face-maryland-sunday-in-first-preseason-tuneup</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/16/mens-basketball-mountaineers-to-face-maryland-sunday-in-first-preseason-tuneup</guid><category>Men's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="West Virginia coach Ross Hodge observes a preseason practice inside the Basketball Practice Facility earlier this fall." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/15/Hodge-Main.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The first of WVU's three exhibition games will take place Sunday inside the XFINITY Center in College Park, Maryland, when West Virginia takes on the Maryland Terrapins in a 3 p.m. clash streaming live on the Big Ten Network's B1G+.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/15/Hodge-Main.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/15/Hodge-Main.jpg"><media:title>West Virginia coach Ross Hodge observes a preseason practice inside the Basketball Practice Facility earlier this fall.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/15/Hodge-Main.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:09:00 EST</pubDate><s:sp